WEBVTT

NOTE
The Dollet SeeD Field Exam mission launch sequence.
Shows the approach from Balamb Garden to the Dollet coast.
Duration: approximately 1 minute 18 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Fade in. Galbadian ships cruise in formation, their reflections rippling across the water beneath a large full moon set against a dark teal night sky.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
The “full moon” is revealed as a reflection shimmering on the water below.

00:18.000 --> 00:28.000
Scene change to daytime. SeeD ships continue cruising along the Dollet coast under a warm orange sunset sky.

00:28.000 --> 00:32.000
On the upper deck, Squall looks out toward the coast.

00:32.000 --> 00:41.000
Squall reviews a reconnaissance photograph of Dollet’s harbor and a hill topped with a Communication Tower.

00:41.000 --> 00:48.000
The beach invasion of the harbor begins. SeeD soldiers charge forward through fire and explosions.

00:48.000 --> 00:51.000
Close-up of Squall face, serious expression.

00:51.000 --> 00:58.000
Ships hover above the water, gliding forward as they speed into the attack.

00:58.000 --> 01:09.000
Two SeeD hovercraft push through Dollet’s stone harbor entrance under a red sunset sky.

01:09.000 --> 01:13.000
They settle onto the beach, and one ship’s ramp-style doors slide upward and open.
